      "scope": "Replace glibc-private __off64_t with POSIX off_t and assert >=64-bit; omit glibc execinfo backtrace on Cosmopolitan while retaining fatal signal diagnostics. No variant-calling algorithm changes."
    },
    {
      "file": "compat/llrintl.c",
      "sha256": "ab5e428a84aa3a5076faaf8737222113e6eff2abea41ff965bdeb83d8d7cbdd2",
      "scope": "Supply missing C99 long-double to long-long conversion with byte-for-byte upstream musl1.2.5 x86-64 code, preserving x87 precision and rounding mode. The initial lrintl delegation was rejected because Cosmopolitan3.3.10 lrintl crashes; it is not in the shipped binary."
    },
    {
      "scope": "Use upstream bundled source lists directly; unused Meson system-library probes for WFA2/lzma are not linked. No WFA2 algorithm is called by these bundled sources. Standard zlib symbols come from Cosmopolitan libc in the portable executable."
    }
